{"seq":1,"slug":"odr-vtr-metric-definition-window","title":"平台卖家账户健康：ODR/VTR 等绩效指标的定义、口径与统计窗口","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketplace-seller-account-health-performance-appeal/account-health-metric-model/odr-vtr-metric-definition-window","wordCount":2853,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"平台卖家账户健康-odr-vtr-等绩效指标的定义-口径与统计窗口\">平台卖家账户健康：ODR/VTR 等绩效指标的定义、口径与统计窗口</h1><p>触发的从不是「某一笔订单出了问题」，而是某个滚动窗口内的比率越过了平台公告的阈值。这意味着账户健康系统的工程对象不是订单，而是<strong>指标</strong>：谁进分子、谁进分母、窗口多长、事件迟到多久才算终值。亚马逊、沃尔玛、eBay、Shopee 的账户健康页把这些参数公之于众，却又各自留了口径细节（去重规则、事件时间、恢复期），留给卖家一套必须自己实现的复算管道。本文从分子分母定义讲到窗口的时间语义与迟到事件回填，给出跨境卖家可落地的指标模型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>账户健康指标模型的本质，是把成千上万笔订单的<strong>离散状态事件</strong>压缩成少数几个<strong>带窗口的比率</strong>，并保证与平台后台展示的值可复现地对齐。链路分四层：事件采集 → 指标口径 → 窗口聚合 → 阈值判定与预警。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;订单/物流/评价/索赔事件&lt;br/&gt;event stream&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;事件归一化&lt;br/&gt;order_id 主键去重&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;缺陷/晚发/取消标记&lt;br/&gt;metric flags&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;滑动窗口聚合&lt;br/&gt;7d / 30d / 60d&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;比率指标&lt;br/&gt;ODR / VTR / LSR / CR&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;阈值判定&lt;br/&gt;healthy / at-risk / unhealthy&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;预警与预留金动作&quot;]&#10;    H[&quot;迟到事件回填&lt;br/&gt;chargeback / A-to-z / 退款&quot;] --&gt; D\">graph TD\n    A[\"订单/物流/评价/索赔事件&lt;br/&gt;event stream\"] --&gt; B[\"事件归一化&lt;br/&gt;order_id 主键去重\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"缺陷/晚发/取消标记&lt;br/&gt;metric flags\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"滑动窗口聚合&lt;br/&gt;7d / 30d / 60d\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"比率指标&lt;br/&gt;ODR / VTR / LSR / CR\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"阈值判定&lt;br/&gt;healthy / at-risk / unhealthy\"]\n    F --&gt; G[\"预警与预留金动作\"]\n    H[\"迟到事件回填&lt;br/&gt;chargeback / A-to-z / 退款\"] --&gt; D</pre><p>四层的职责与失败模式必须对齐，否则「后台显示 0.9%、自己算 1.3%」这类口径分歧会直接击穿预警系统的可信度：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>输出</th>\n<th>典型失败模式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>事件归一化</td>\n<td>以订单为主键的统一事件</td>\n<td>同一缺陷重复计数，一次取消既算缺陷又算取消率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>指标口径</td>\n<td>每条指标的分子/分母定义</td>\n<td>分母漏掉已取消订单、分子把 3 星评价误判为缺陷</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>窗口聚合</td>\n<td>滑动窗口比率</td>\n<td>用处理时间代替事件时间，窗口边界错位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>阈值判定</td>\n<td>状态与预警</td>\n<td>阈值硬编码，平台改口径后无人跟进</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键洞察：<strong>平台的比率是滚动窗口的快照，不是累计值</strong>。窗口每前进一天，旧事件滑出、新事件滑入，同一个「本月已发货」的订单可能在 45 天后因为一笔迟到的信用卡拒付（chargeback）重新进入分子。指标模型必须为这种<strong>迟到回填</strong>设计，否则预警永远是过去式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"odr-订单缺陷率-分子分母的精确口径\">ODR（订单缺陷率）：分子分母的精确口径</h2><p>订单缺陷率（Order Defect Rate, ODR）是账户健康的核心指标。以亚马逊卖家平台账户健康页公布的口径为准（截至 2026 年），ODR 的统计窗口为<strong>滚动 60 天</strong>，目标阈值是<strong>低于 1%</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>D</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mn>60</mn><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>o</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>O</mi><mrow><mn>60</mn><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>:</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>o</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo></mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo><msub><mi>O</mi><mrow><mn>60</mn><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ODR_{60d}(t) = \\frac{\\left|\\{\\, o \\in O_{60d}(t) \\;:\\; defect(o) = \\top \\,\\right|}{\\left| O_{60d}(t) \\right|}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">60</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">60</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">∣</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">∣</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">60</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ec</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">⊤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">∣</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>O</mi><mrow><mn>60</mn><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O_{60d}(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">60</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是截至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 的历史 60 天内<strong>全部订单</strong>的集合，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>o</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">defect(o)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ec</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是订单级布尔量，命中以下三类事件中任意一类即为真（来源：Amazon Seller Central 账户健康帮助页《Order Defect Rate》）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>差评（Negative Feedback）</strong>：买家给出 1 星或 2 星评价；</li>\n<li><strong>商城交易保障索赔（A-to-z Guarantee Claim）</strong>：买家发起且未被判卖家无责；</li>\n<li><strong>信用卡拒付（Chargeback）</strong>：发卡行发起的拒付，无论最终裁决结果。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>三个口径细节决定自建复算能否对齐后台：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>订单级去重。</strong> 分子按订单计数而非按事件计数。同一订单既有差评又有 A-to-z 索赔只计 1 次；直接累计事件条数会系统性高估 ODR。</li>\n<li><strong>分母是全部订单。</strong> 分母包含窗口内所有订单，取消的订单通常也计入（取消率是另一指标，剔除会与平台口径不一致），因此分母是「订单量」而非「成交订单量」。</li>\n<li><strong>事件时间优先。</strong> 一笔 60 天前发货的订单，其 chargeback 可能在发卡行处理后回传；回传时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 晚于事件时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时，缺陷应落回 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 所在窗口，而非计入今天。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>三类事件的延迟差异极大：差评一般在收货后 1–14 天出现，A-to-z 索赔在预计送达日后数天至 30 天，chargeback 在发卡行争议周期下可达 60–120 天。因此 <strong>60 天窗口的 ODR 数值并不稳定</strong>——今天的 0.9% 可能在三周后回填成 1.05%。复算系统按日快照存历史时，必须区分「当时的读数」与「回填后的终值」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"vtr-lsr-预发货取消率-履约侧指标群\">VTR、LSR、预发货取消率：履约侧指标群</h2><p>ODR 度量的是<strong>交易结果</strong>，VTR/LSR/CR 度量的是<strong>履约过程</strong>。它们共享同一类分子分母结构，但窗口更短、阈值更贴近日常运营：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>英文/缩写</th>\n<th>分子</th>\n<th>分母</th>\n<th>窗口</th>\n<th>目标阈值（Amazon，2026）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>有效追踪率</td>\n<td>Valid Tracking Rate (VTR)</td>\n<td>带有有效承运商单号的可追踪货件</td>\n<td>全部货件</td>\n<td>30 天</td>\n<td>≥ 95%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>迟发率</td>\n<td>Late Shipment Rate (LSR)</td>\n<td>超过承诺发货日才确认发货的订单</td>\n<td>全部订单</td>\n<td>10 天与 30 天</td>\n<td>&lt; 4%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预发货取消率</td>\n<td>Pre-fulfillment Cancel Rate (CR)</td>\n<td>卖家在发货前主动取消的订单</td>\n<td>全部订单</td>\n<td>7 天</td>\n<td>&lt; 2.5%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>订单缺陷率</td>\n<td>Order Defect Rate (ODR)</td>\n<td>含差评/索赔/拒付的订单</td>\n<td>全部订单</td>\n<td>60 天</td>\n<td>&lt; 1%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>（来源：Amazon Seller Central 账户健康「配送绩效」「客户服务绩效」各组帮助页；阈值为平台公布的卖家目标值，平台可按站点调整。）</p>\n<p>三个必须写进代码的口径约定：</p>\n<p><strong>VTR 的「有效」是白名单判定，不是格式判定。</strong> 单号必须来自平台认可的承运商、匹配该承运商的标准单号格式，且货件可被平台追踪接口查到节点。一个形如 <code>1Z</code> 开头但未被实际揽收的 UPS 单号不算「有效」。实现上维护「承运商 × 单号正则 × 追踪 API」映射表，做三级校验：白名单 → 单号正则/校验位 → 追踪节点是否回传。</p>\n<p><strong>LSR 参照「承诺发货日」。</strong> 承诺发货日由商品处理时效（handling time）+ 订单时刻推导；超期未确认发货即计入分子，即使后来补发也一样。</p>\n<p><strong>CR 只统计「卖家主动取消」。</strong> 亚马逊把「因无库存而取消」也计入卖家取消率（反映库存管理能力），这是新卖家最常踩的坑；买家取消、平台风控取消是否计入则各平台不同。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>o</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>O</mi><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>:</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>o</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo></mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo><msub><mi>O</mi><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CR_{7d}(t) = \\frac{\\left|\\{\\, o \\in O_{7d}(t) : canceled\\_by\\_seller(o) = \\top \\,\\right|}{\\left| O_{7d}(t) \\right|}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.526em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.59em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">∣</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.74em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:1.2em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"1.2em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 1200\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v0 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v0 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v0 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ce</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">⊤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:1.2em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"1.2em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 1200\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v0 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v0 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v0 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>短窗口指标的共同陷阱是「小样本放大」。</strong> 7 天窗口内若只有 30 笔订单，1 笔取消就是 3.3%，直接越过 2.5% 阈值——但这不代表履约恶化。预警系统应对短窗口指标做<strong>最小样本量门槛</strong>（如分母 &lt; 50 时降级为观察态），展示层同时给出分子分母原始计数，而不是只给比率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"统计窗口与时间语义-事件时间-处理时间与回填\">统计窗口与时间语义：事件时间、处理时间与回填</h2><p>比率本身很简单，难的是窗口。同一个 <code>ODR &lt; 1%</code> 在不同时间语义下值完全不同：**事件时间（event time）**是缺陷实际发生的时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；**处理时间（processing time）**是事件流进统计系统的时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；<strong>平台展示时间</strong>是后台刷新批次时刻，通常每日一次。</p>\n<p>平台公布的是<strong>按事件时间</strong>归入滚动窗口的值，自建系统若按处理时间聚合会产生系统性偏差。滚动 60 天窗口在日粒度下定义为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>D</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mn>60</mn><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>59</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>59</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ODR_{60d}(t) = \\frac{\\sum_{i=t-59}^{t} d_i}{\\sum_{i=t-59}^{t} n_i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">60</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.863em;vertical-align:-1.1815em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6815em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.1765em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9335em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">59</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.748em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9335em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">59</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1815em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 分别是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 天的缺陷订单数与订单总数。回填会让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum d_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 随时间变化：今天算出的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>59</mn></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[d_{t-59}, \\ldots, d_t]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">59</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 中，靠左的若干天会在未来被新的 chargeback 改写。工程上把「截至某日的事件已全部到齐」称为<strong>水印（watermark）</strong>——只有当日 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的水印已越过，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 才是终值，任何以终值为前提的告警（如「本季度 ODR 超标将触发预留金」）必须建立在越过水印的窗口上。</p>\n<p>另一层坑在<strong>时区</strong>：跨境卖家同时经营美区/欧区/日区，平台的「一天」按站点本地时区切，用 UTC 统一切天会让跨日订单落错窗口；<strong>滑动 vs 分桶</strong>：平台展示的是滑动窗口（每天前滚一格），内部报表若用自然月分桶会与后台对不上，所有对客口径指标都必须实现为滑动窗口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"指标口径工程落地-可复算的聚合管道\">指标口径工程落地：可复算的聚合管道</h2><p>把口径固化成一条可复算、可对账的管道，是账户健康运营系统与「每天早上手看后台」的分水岭：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;订单库 / 物流轨迹 / 评价库 / 索赔库&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;增量事件抽取&lt;br/&gt;CDC / 变更日志&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;事件归一化&lt;br/&gt;统一 order_id + event_time&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;缺陷与应用标记打标&lt;br/&gt;defect_flag / late_flag / cancel_flag&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[(指标事实表&lt;br/&gt;day × marketplace × metric)]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;滑动窗口物化视图&lt;br/&gt;7d / 30d / 60d&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;对账任务&lt;br/&gt;与平台后台读数比对&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; H[&quot;偏差告警与口径修正&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; I[&quot;运营看板 + 阈值预警&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"订单库 / 物流轨迹 / 评价库 / 索赔库\"] --&gt; B[\"增量事件抽取&lt;br/&gt;CDC / 变更日志\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"事件归一化&lt;br/&gt;统一 order_id + event_time\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"缺陷与应用标记打标&lt;br/&gt;defect_flag / late_flag / cancel_flag\"]\n    D --&gt; E[(指标事实表&lt;br/&gt;day × marketplace × metric)]\n    E --&gt; F[\"滑动窗口物化视图&lt;br/&gt;7d / 30d / 60d\"]\n    F --&gt; G[\"对账任务&lt;br/&gt;与平台后台读数比对\"]\n    G --&gt; H[\"偏差告警与口径修正\"]\n    F --&gt; I[\"运营看板 + 阈值预警\"]</pre><p>关键设计四点：<strong>以订单为主键的事实表</strong>（每行是「某日/某站点/某订单/是否缺陷/是否晚发/是否卖家取消」，允许 chargeback 把 <code>defect_flag</code> 由假改真，承载回填）；<strong>物化视图而非实时重算</strong>（7/30/60 天窗口每日批物化，回填只影响最近 60–120 天分区）；<strong>每日对账</strong>（抓取平台读数与自算值比对，偏差超容许带即告警，通常意味着平台改了口径）；<strong>口径版本化</strong>（每条告警记录绑定的事件定义/窗口/阈值版本，平台改政策新增版本而非就地覆盖）。</p>\n<p>不同平台的口径差异是跨境系统必须编码的一等公民（来源：各平台卖家规则公开页，Amazon/Walmart/eBay/Shopee Seller Standards，2026）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>平台</th>\n<th>缺陷类指标</th>\n<th>履约类核心阈值</th>\n<th>评估节奏</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Amazon</td>\n<td>ODR &lt; 1%（60 天滚动）</td>\n<td>LSR &lt; 4%、CR &lt; 2.5%、VTR ≥ 95%</td>\n<td>每日刷新，AHR 连续计分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Walmart</td>\n<td>Order Defect Rate ≤ 2%</td>\n<td>On-Time Delivery ≥ 90%、Cancellation ≤ 2%、VTR ≥ 99%</td>\n<td>滚动评估，二元判定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>eBay</td>\n<td>Transaction Defect Rate ≤ 2%</td>\n<td>Late Shipment ≤ 5%、Cases closed without seller resolution ≤ 0.3%</td>\n<td>12 个月/季度评估</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shopee</td>\n<td>违规扣分 + 订单未完成率</td>\n<td>迟发率、取消率、退货退款率各自阈值</td>\n<td>周/月评估，扣分累积触发限流</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>亚马逊另有把多指标加权汇总成单一分数的<strong>账户健康评级（Account Health Rating, AHR）</strong>，0–1000 分制，绿/黄/红三档（来源：Amazon Account Health Rating 机制）。AHR 是<strong>累积计分</strong>而非比率：一次严重违规的扣分不会因 60 天后订单滚出而自动消失，必须通过申诉或等待分值规则恢复——这也是 <a href=\"../appeal-reinstatement-workflow/\">申诉与恢复工作流</a> 的入口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>工程对象是<strong>带窗口的比率</strong>而非订单；四个核心指标 7d/30d/60d 各挂一个窗口，与平台滑动口径必须逐日对齐。</li>\n<li><strong>ODR 口径三件事</strong>：分子按订单去重、分母是全部订单、事件时间归入窗口；chargeback 的 60–120 天延迟使 60 天窗口读数「暂时」，需区分当时值与回填终值。</li>\n<li><strong>VTR/LSR/CR 是履约过程指标</strong>：VTR 的「有效」是承运商白名单判定，LSR 参照承诺发货日，CR 只算卖家主动取消（含无库存取消）。</li>\n<li><strong>时间语义是最大偏差源</strong>：事件时间 vs 处理时间、站点时区切天、滑动窗口 vs 自然分桶，任一处用错都会与后台对不上。</li>\n<li>落地靠<strong>可复算管道 + 每日对账 + 口径版本化</strong>：订单级缺陷事实表承载回填，物化视图承载窗口，对账任务捕捉口径漂移。</li>\n<li>输出对接后续章节：<a href=\"../violation-takedown-monitoring/\">违规与下架监控</a>、<a href=\"../appeal-reinstatement-workflow/\">申诉恢复</a>、<a href=\"../reserve-cashflow-prevention-ops/\">资金预留与现金流运营</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"平台卖家账户健康：ODR/VTR 等绩效指标的定义、口径与统计窗口","id":"平台卖家账户健康-odr-vtr-等绩效指标的定义-口径与统计窗口"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"ODR（订单缺陷率）：分子分母的精确口径","id":"odr-订单缺陷率-分子分母的精确口径"},{"level":2,"text":"VTR、LSR、预发货取消率：履约侧指标群","id":"vtr-lsr-预发货取消率-履约侧指标群"},{"level":2,"text":"统计窗口与时间语义：事件时间、处理时间与回填","id":"统计窗口与时间语义-事件时间-处理时间与回填"},{"level":2,"text":"指标口径工程落地：可复算的聚合管道","id":"指标口径工程落地-可复算的聚合管道"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"绩效阈值分级与账户状态机（Good/At-Risk/Critical）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketplace-seller-account-health-performance-appeal/account-health-metric-model/metric-threshold-state-machine"}}